# CI output
/build/
/screenshots/

# The car pack "Low Poly Cars" by Cosmo as Hajun downloaded it, and its own
# pictures of its cars (2026-11-25): its licence lets the cars be changed and
# built into the game, which assets/cars/<name>.glb and .png are, and not handed
# on as they came, which this repository being public would do. Kept on this PC.
assets/cars/lowpoly_cars_premium/
assets/cars/previews/

# Blender's copy of a .blend as it was before its last save: never kept
# (2026-11-25, Hajun: "ye remove them and ignore blend1").
*.blend1

# Firebase's settings for the Android app (2026-11-27, pushes; docs/house.md),
# which its console gives: kept on this PC, the repository being public. The
# server's keys for pushing (Firebase's service account, Apple's .p8) are kept
# on the VM alone, never here.
mobile/android/app/google-services.json
*.p8
